# No duplicate implementations

Never maintain parallel implementations of the same UI component, menu behavior, formatter, or service helper. Before writing a component or helper, search `packages/*` and `apps/web/src/**` for an existing one and extend it in place.

## Canonical implementations

### Collage UI and interactive controls

- **Cards, tags, buttons, and filter pills:** `PaperCard`, `PaperTag`, `PaperButton`, `PaperPills`, and `PaperStrip` in `apps/web/src/app/collage/`
- **Dropdown and hover menus:** `HoverMenu`, `PillMenu`, `PillMenuList`, `PillMenuOption`, and `YearMenu` in `apps/web/src/app/collage/PillMenu.tsx` and `apps/web/src/app/collage/YearMenu.tsx` (never wire `bindHoverMenu` or `<details className="chrome__music">` directly in route or layout components)
- **Cutouts, seals, tickets, and stamps:** `CutOut`, `CutLetters`, `Scallop`, `Stub`, and `scallopVertices` in `apps/web/src/app/collage/` and `apps/web/src/app/music/stats/StatsShapes.tsx`
- **Side project marks:** `SideProjectMark` in `apps/web/src/app/home/GatteySitesCard.tsx`
- **Loading skeletons:** `Skeleton` in `@dg/ui/core/Skeleton` (never define route-local `SkeletonLine` components or raw `data-skeleton` elements)
- **Maps:** `@dg/maps` (`MapCard`, `RoutePrint`, `RoutePeek`, `RouteAtlasMap`)
- **Spotify playback status:** `PlaybackStatus` in `apps/web/src/app/spotify/PlaybackStatus.tsx`

### Formatters and dates

- **Relative time and hydration-safe clock:** `RelativeTime` in `@dg/ui/core/RelativeTime` and `useServerTime` / `useNow` in `@dg/ui/core/ServerTimeContext`
- **Integer counts and distances:** `formatCount`, `formattedDistance`, and `METERS_PER_MILE` in `@dg/shared-core/formatting/formattedDistance`, plus Strava unit helpers (`formatMiles`, `formatFeet`, `formatCompactFeet`, `formatHours`, `formatDuration`, `formatOutingDay`, `formatOutingDate`) in `apps/web/src/app/activities/stravaFormat.ts`
- **Calendar buckets, year ticks (`’17`), and UTC short dates (`Oct 15, 2024` / `Oct 15`):** `periodStatus`, `SITE_TIME_ZONE`, `formatYearTick`, and `formatUtcShortDate` in `@dg/shared-core/dates/periodStatus`

### Auth, OAuth, and service helpers

- **Constant-time string comparison and Basic Auth:** `timingSafeEqualStrings` and `isDevConsoleAccessAllowed` in `@dg/services/auth/devConsoleBasicAuth`
- **Cron Bearer authentication:** `isCronAuthorized` in `apps/web/src/app/api/apiResponses.ts`
- **OAuth token validation and persistence:** `validateSpotifyTokenResponse` in `@dg/services/spotify/spotifyClient`, `validateRawDataToToken` in `@dg/services/strava/stravaClient`, and `upsertAndCacheToken` in `@dg/services/clients/refreshedAccessToken`

## Rules when refactoring or adding features

1. **Extend the canonical module instead of copying it.** If a route needs a new option on `Skeleton`, `HoverMenu`, or a formatter, add that option to the shared implementation.
2. **Migrate callers and delete legacy code in the same PR.** Never leave an older component or helper alongside its replacement.
3. **Encode structural guards in `packages/cli/src/check-structure.ts`.** When unifying a recurring duplicate pattern, add a fast check in `@dg/cli` so `pnpm exec turbo check` blocks regressions in CI.
